<main id="content" class="site-main post mt-article"><div class="page-header"><h1 class="entry-title">Premade Indoor Water Walls VS Custom Water Walls</h1></div><div class="page-content"><p class="mt-article-meta"><time datetime="2021-05-05T05:23:08">May 5, 2021</time></p><figure class="mt-article-hero"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls.jpg" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls-jpg-800x533.avif 800w, /wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls-jpg.avif 600w, /wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls.jpg 813w, /wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls-jpg-813x320.avif 813w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 860px" width="813" height="542" alt="Premade Indoor Water Walls VS Custom Water Walls" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></figure><div class="mt-article-body"><p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="78026" data-permalink="https://www.midwest-tropical.com/moving-boxes-in-new-apartment-real-estate-concept-8/" data-orig-file="/wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls.jpg" data-orig-size="813,542" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="/wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls-jpg.avif" crossorigin="anonymous" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-78026" src="/wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls1.jpg" alt="Premade Indoor Water Walls VS Custom Water Walls" width="813" height="542" title="" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls-600x400.avif 600w, /wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls-jpg-800x533.avif 800w, /wp-content/uploads/Premade-Indoor-Water-Walls-VS-Custom-Water-Walls-jpg.avif 813w" sizes="(max-width: 813px) 100vw, 813px" data-mtfi="1"></p>
<p>With minimalism prevailing, interior Decor trends are changing dramatically too. However, the indoor water walls are not going anywhere anytime soon because of their sensory details, cool aesthetics, and state-of-the-art looks.</p>
<p>It is because more and more educated minimalists love bringing natural elements like waterfalls and rockeries indoors, and water walls are no exception. But with hundreds of options available at high-end brands, how do you find the one that&#x2122;s perfect for your commercial space? Midwest Tropical has a wide range of water walls, but you need to decide beforehand if you would like to get a pre-made stock water wall or a water wall that is custom-made for your particular business.</p>
<p>Here&#x2122;s how they differ:</p>
<p><strong>The Duration of Installation</strong></p>
<p>When once they are ready, both options can be quickly installed in the desired region of your commercial property. However, most pre-made indoor water walls can be brought to the site instantly, while water features with custom water wall panels (ones with brand aesthetics) require time. Crafting them takes time since more effort and attention is required to incorporate each detail.</p>
<h2><strong>Brand Outlook and Coherence</strong></h2>
<p>If you are a big business planning to install a water feature in a long corridor or a welcome lobby, it is advisable to opt for custom water wall panels. You can choose to get the background designed as per your brand design, where the professionals would choose colors that match with your logo, tagline and overall color scheme. The design process may take time, but the output would surely be coherent with your overall commercial space, interior decor, and architecture.</p>
<h2><strong>Customization Options in water walls</strong></h2>
<p>While you can choose from hundreds of different water wall panels even in pre-made water walls, there are also limited options for customization. Opt for playback music and LED fairy lights of your choice, size, and other dimension options depending upon the part of the commercial property you are installing this water feature in.</p>
<p>If you have a restaurant or pub, with already loud music playing, playback wouldn&#x2122;t matter much at night time. Similarly, if it&#x2122;s a dentist&#x2122;s office, a light relaxing, meditating sound would work its wonders.</p>
<p><strong>Size</strong><strong><br />
</strong>Ready-made water walls are good for small to medium-sized spaces. However, if you&#x2122;d like to cover a huge wall or widely spacious area, it&#x2122;s better to go for custom water walls. They are usually the best bets for old shopping malls getting renovated or museums and public offices where construction is partly under progress.</p>
<h2><strong>Indoor Water Walls Create An Incredible Architectural Statement</strong></h2>
<p>Not only water walls but there are endless other options to consider if you&#x2122;d like to create a signature interior decor that&#x2122;s unique to your brand, but popular worldwide. Vertical chamber water walls, indoor fountains, rain curtains, and reflection pools are only a few to count.</p>
<p>When it comes to bringing nature in contact with humanity, there is no limit to creativity. Whatever you can imagine, Midwest Tropical can turn it into reality. All you have to do is think of a spectacular background and watch Midwest Tropical do its magic!</p>
</div></div></main>

